    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"choosing to stop contributing to the noise\"... that's a heavy way to put it. it sounds like you're saying it's actually more rational to just opt out instead of struggling against entropy. like, if the outcome is guaranteed, then seeking an earlier end isn't being \"sad,\" it's just being logical? is that what you mean?",
